## Implementation

The implementation commit 40d51889 changes one file. `git show --name-only --format= 40d51889`
prints only `dashboard/scripts/storytime/make-manual-pdf.ts`.

The file gains:

- the export `manualPdfHtml(weeks, { lang, loops, share, bookPages })` with JSDoc;
- the unit page list `storytimeStudentBookPages(readLevelWeeks(STORYTIME_ROOT, weeks[0].meta.level)...)`
  when `bookPages` is true, and no `studentBookPages` value (undefined) when it is false;
- the flag `--book-pages` in the argument loop and in `USAGE`;
- `main` uses the helper, so there is one `compileStorytimeManual` call;
- the `process.argv[1]` entry guard (as `check-weeks.ts`).

The helper destructures `{ lang, loops, share, bookPages }` and passes shorthand properties. The
older `loops` AST test `storytime-loops-teacher-book.test.ts` needs the `loops` initializer text to
be `loops`, so the first GREEN run failed on that test, and the restructure in the implementation
fixed it. No test file changed.

`main` now prints `weeks.length` where it printed `result.weekCount`. The value is the same for a
non-empty week list.

